  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Chlorofluorocarbons&nbsp; are chemicals which contain carbon, chlorine and fluorine. Ozone layer breaks when these CFC&#39;s are released&nbsp; into the atmosphere.So. Chlorine&nbsp;is one of the radical which belongs to CFC&#39;s family, responsible for break down.</p>"
